  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuanyanglong\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Yuanyanglong\">Yuanyanglong bainian</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype (<b>PV02476-1</b>) and referred (<b>PV02476-2</b>) specimens. The reconstructed skull is somewhat tentative given its poor preservation. Scale bar=20 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PV02476-1)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF8155\" title=\"#FF8155\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PV02476-2)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fj.cretres.2024.106023\">\"A new oviraptorosaur from the Lower Cretaceous Miaogou Formation of western Inner Mongolia, China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/theropods/caudipteryx\"><i>Caudipteryx</i> skeletal diagram</a> by Scott Hartman</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-019-55038-5\">\"Birdlike growth and mixed-age flocks in avimimids (Theropoda, Oviraptorosauria)\"</a></li>\n<li><cite class=\"book\" style=\"font-style:normal\" id=\"Reference-Paul-2024\">Paul, Gregory S. (2024)      <i> The Princeton Field Guide to Dinosaurs</i> (3rd ed.), Princeton, N.J.:  Princeton University Press  <small><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:ISBN\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">ISBN</span></a></span>:  <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/9978-0-691-23157-0\" title=\"Special:BookSources/9978-0-691-23157-0\">9978-0-691-23157-0</a>. </small></cite></li></ul>",
